{"reviewId": "233883411_8aGpjn8PP", "review": {"abstract": "石油危机造成的原材料高成本在欧洲煤炭、钢铁、能源共同体协议之间得到有效化解，使得高通胀的压力消耗于欧洲各国之间，而日本只能独自承受高通胀带来的负面冲击。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "04 长波衰退中的增长与通胀", "chapterUid": 9, "content": "目前的日本，美伊战争的最大受害者，这个国际的资源完全依赖外部，和周边资源大国关系都很差，政治上又惟美国马首是瞻，霍尔姆斯海峡就成了他的命门，战争越激烈他受到的影响越大。从今天的角度来看，日本越来越极端化，要小心他偷袭中国！（2026.7.18）", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "range": "9628-9704", "createTime": 1784345790, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 9, "reviewId": "233883411_8aGpjn8PP", "userVid": 233883411, "topics": [], "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "04 长波衰退中的增长与通胀", "author": {"userVid": 233883411, "name": "夢想之路", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/rKBCaRcVshOibD07LJrpH3WAomLy16tv7PFud7toakSktKaetuqZRcUZFtrg6IIayQatA2z94YTc/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-10", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 3, "likes": [{"userVid": 545915395, "name": "超超", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0002-KCu5_vzga~FNxeWDaCxnQe8/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "超超", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240805-25", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "狂暴阅读周", "levelIndex": 25}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments":